{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## What\n\nParametrize the existing detector and close-guard suites over both `[non-codebase]` and\n`[operator-attested]` so the alias has an explicit regression suite rather than relying on the\nold tests incidentally still passing.\n\n## Scope\n\nAdd a both-spellings case to: `tests/unit/test_det_attestation_launder.py`,\n`tests/unit/test_det_measurement_provenance{,_heldout}.py`,\n`tests/unit/test_attested_close_guard.py`,\n`tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_attested_close_guard_e2e.py`,\n`tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ac_checkbox_precheck{,_heldout}.py`,\n`tests/unit/test_a8e5_operator_attested_edge.py`.\n\nAlso cover the PLAN-TIME surfaces the parent AC names but the guard suites do not reach:\n`tests/unit/test_det_floor_operator_attested.py` (the `p6_ac_quality` advisory lint via\n`operator_evidence_ac_gaps`) and `tests/unit/test_plan_review.py` (the `decide_ops` Pass-3\n`enrich_operator_attested` path). Without these, the parent's five-surface parity claim is\nunproven for two of its five surfaces.\n\nDecide and pin the near-miss policy for the new tag: `[operator_attested]` is a DELIBERATE\nnon-match asserted in ~15 places (ADR-0043). `[non_codebase]` and `[noncodebase]` need the\nsame treatment.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Each listed suite exercises both spellings and asserts identical outcomes.\n- [ ] The plan-time lint (`p6_ac_quality`) and the Pass-3 enrichment (`enrich_operator_attested`)\n      are each proved to treat both spellings identically.\n- [ ] `[non_codebase]` and `[noncodebase]` are asserted NOT to match, mirroring the existing\n      `[operator_attested]` contract.\n- [ ] No existing assertion was weakened to make the new cases pass."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787186832900229001,"uuid":"3a087438-df6b-4418-8f07-f3fd0ec5e684"}